Package: libgbm1
Version: @DEB_GBM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.mesa3d.org/
Description: GBM library (iOS links-only shim)
 iOS has no Mesa GBM device. This package provides an inert GBM ABI shim so
 KWin's non-native DRM/GBM paths can link during first-light bring-up.
